   ],
   "answer": "No, you cannot buy battery packs from Brightcell Energy today [3][6]. \n\nAlthough they quoted £104.00 per pack (DAP Manchester) under quotation Q-BE-26-0917 [1], Northbridge Cycles cannot trade with them or issue purchase orders for the following reasons:\n- Brightcell Energy is not registered in the Ledgerline ERP supplier master and has no active rate contract [1][2][3].\n- Under SOP-PUR-001, onboarding and qualification are currently blocked because their mandatory UN 38.3 compliance test report is undergoing laboratory renewal and is not expected until December 2026 [3][4][5][6].\n- Trading cannot commence until compliance vetting is complete, standard evaluation finishes, and Luis Moreno sends the onboarding pack under SOP-PUR-001 [2]. Qualification documents can be re-evaluated once the renewed report arrives in December 2026 [5][6].",
   "cited": [
    3,
