   "answer": "When calling the `po_save` service, the mandatory (required) fields are [7]:\n\n* `sup_cd` (supplier code) [7]\n* `itm_cd` (item number) [7]\n* `qty` (quantity) [7]\n* `rate` (unit price) [7]\n* `tax_cd` (tax classification) [7]\n* `cc_cd` (cost centre code) [7]\n* `need_dt` (required delivery date) [7]\n\nAdditionally, external callers and integration routines must include the `fetch_tok` token returned by `po_fetch` within the payload, or `po_save` rejects the request with `ERR-SCR-0221` [2][7].",
